        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: The San Quentin Six, George Jackson\n- Organizations: San Quentin State Prison, Black Guerrilla Family\n- Places: California, United States\n- Events: August 21, 1971 San Quentin escape attempt\n\nFacts:\n- On August 21, 1971, an escape attempt at San Quentin State Prison in California left six people dead.\n- George Jackson was a co-founder of the Black Guerrilla Family.\n- George Jackson was among the six people killed in the August 21, 1971 escape attempt at San Quentin State Prison.\n- The San Quentin Six were six inmates at San Quentin State Prison in California.\n- The San Quentin Six were accused of participating in the August 21, 1971 escape attempt at San Quentin State Prison.",
